 stubbornly refuses to leave anyone that it sticks to.","abilities":["Destroyed after taking a certain number of attacks","When attached to a target, deals Arts damage every second and prevents them from using skills"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":12,"atk":40,"def":100,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"duck_lord":{"slug":"duck_lord","name":"Duck Lord","icon":"/enemies-icons/Duck Lord.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A famous Columbian investor, entrepreneur, and master of 'Duck Power.' Out of the public eye, enjoys kicking back with others...","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","Gains significantly increased Movement Speed after being attacked"],"levelCount":3,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":100,"def":200,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"crying_thief":{"slug":"crying_thief","name":"Crying Thief","icon":"/enemies-icons/Crying Thief.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Perro who left his family to seek out a new life... but all that people know is that he is always weeping.","abilities":["Invisible","Attacks Stun the target"],"levelCount":3,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":300,"def":150,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"fatty":{"slug":"fatty","name":"Fatty","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fatty.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Duck Lord's associate and apprentice, an opportunist with a slick tongue. Frequently appears on dubious TV shows, preaching about how he cares little for losses or gains, as they are par